result:
The change is commit `4cc27d388fb4a4fe49316791a20127dbb04e31ae` (PR #1920, ticket O3-6028), "Pass locationsPerRequest to the login location picker and drop numberToShow". The line that passes the configured value to the picker is `openmrs-esm-core/packages/apps/esm-login-app/src/location-picker/location-picker-view.component.tsx:181`, which sets `locationsPerRequest={Math.max(chooseLocation.locationsPerRequest, 1)}` on `<LocationPicker>`.

Supporting evidence, best first:

1. `openmrs-esm-core/packages/apps/esm-login-app/src/location-picker/location-picker-view.component.tsx:181`: the login app passes the configured value, floored at 1, to the picker. @file:{openmrs-esm-core::packages/apps/esm-login-app/src/location-picker/location-picker-view.component.tsx:181}
2. `openmrs-esm-core/packages/framework/esm-styleguide/src/location-picker/location-picker.component.tsx:19-27`: the picker accepts `locationsPerRequest` and defaults it to 50. This default is why the value was always 50 before the fix. @file:{openmrs-esm-core::packages/framework/esm-styleguide/src/location-picker/location-picker.component.tsx:19-27}
3. `openmrs-esm-core/packages/framework/esm-styleguide/src/location-picker/location-picker.component.tsx:42`: the picker passes `locationsPerRequest` into `useLocations`, so the page size reaches the request. @file:{openmrs-esm-core::packages/framework/esm-styleguide/src/location-picker/location-picker.component.tsx:42}
4. `openmrs-esm-core/packages/apps/esm-login-app/src/location-picker/location-picker.test.tsx:435-457`: tests that the configured value reaches the picker and that zero falls back to 1. @file:{openmrs-esm-core::packages/apps/esm-login-app/src/location-picker/location-picker.test.tsx:435-457}
5. `openmrs-esm-core/packages/apps/esm-login-app/src/config-schema.ts:44`: the `locationsPerRequest` config definition. @file:{openmrs-esm-core::packages/apps/esm-login-app/src/config-schema.ts:44}
6. `openmrs-esm-core/.changeset/login-locations-per-request.md:5`: the changeset describing the fix and the removal of the unused `numberToShow` property. @file:{openmrs-esm-core::.changeset/login-locations-per-request.md:5}

The commit's ticket is O3-6028, and Falkon's provenance links it to PR #1920 as verified.

